# Authentication

Approved auth is Firebase Authentication with password sign-in. Do not add another auth product without approval.

- Sign-in and sign-out go through Firebase Authentication.
- Shop Admin, Store Keeper, and Cashier are stored in the app data model (SQLite, synced to Cloud Firestore). They are not chosen on the login screen.
- A user may have one or more of those three roles. Do not add any other role.
- Do not add a role dropdown to the login screen.
